RtpSender::generate_key_frame: libwebrtc's RtpSenderInterface::GenerateKeyFrame (in the prebuilt, behind the sender's
proxy) bound for Rust. The Teams mixer asks a sender for a keyframe with an RTCP FIR and sends the same FIR again while
it waits; libwebrtc ignores a FIR whose sequence number it saw before, so a request it already answered once is never
answered again. ngteams forces the keyframe the mixer still waits for (crates/teams-media/src/session/keyframes.rs).

